      4. The specific disciplinary outcome (e.g., 3-day suspension).
      5. The DIRECT URL to the PDF document on austintexas.gov. Do not use search result redirects.`,
      config: {
        tools: [{ googleSearch: {} }],
        responseMimeType: "application/json",
        responseSchema: {
          type: Type.OBJECT,
          properties: {
            incidentDate: { type: Type.STRING },
            officerName: { type: Type.STRING },
